{"id":"e59c38a3b7ccf012","group":"90","path":"90/90-prop-rosser-sentence.md","title":"Rosser Sentence Property","display":"prop-rosser-sentence — Rosser Sentence Property","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference","book_abbrev":"90","label":"90-prop-rosser-sentence","aliases":["90-prop-rosser-sentence"],"display":"prop-rosser-sentence — Rosser Sentence Property","depends_on":["[[88-df-provable]]","[[90-df-rosser-sentence]]","[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","[[90-lem-q-finite-comparison]]","[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","[[90-df-representation]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Diagonalization and Self-Reference"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"90"},{"key":"label","html":"90-prop-rosser-sentence"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>90-prop-rosser-sentence</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-rosser-sentence — Rosser Sentence Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" href=\"?note=b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9\" title=\"88-df-provable\">88-df-provable</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7c51b51998a67f02\" href=\"?note=7c51b51998a67f02\" title=\"90-df-rosser-sentence\">90-df-rosser-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4e89323a1592aeb9\" href=\"?note=4e89323a1592aeb9\" title=\"90-df-consistency-statement\">90-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b7d7a03ff76428de\" href=\"?note=b7d7a03ff76428de\" title=\"90-df-robinson-arithmetic\">90-df-robinson-arithmetic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"002c574215686062\" href=\"?note=002c574215686062\" title=\"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory\">90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"25356da0f2b0b22e\" href=\"?note=25356da0f2b0b22e\" title=\"90-lem-q-finite-comparison\">90-lem-q-finite-comparison</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"635265d0fe56f718\" href=\"?note=635265d0fe56f718\" title=\"90-df-representation\">90-df-representation</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> 必须满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8c071ce52fa72de0\" href=\"?note=8c071ce52fa72de0\" title=\"90-df-proof-predicate\">90-df-proof-predicate</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span>-逐数表示条件；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"278a6c2cfc6160a3\" href=\"?note=278a6c2cfc6160a3\" title=\"90-df-arithmetic-language\">90-df-arithmetic-language</a> 的算术缩写，固定数码比较用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"25356da0f2b0b22e\" href=\"?note=25356da0f2b0b22e\" title=\"90-lem-q-finite-comparison\">90-lem-q-finite-comparison</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,g\">\\(S,g\\)</span> (fixed arithmetic signature and effective Gödel numbering)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (theory with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(R\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (sentence)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RosserSent}_T(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{RosserSent}_T(R)\\)</span> (Rosser-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"7c51b51998a67f02\" href=\"?note=7c51b51998a67f02\" title=\"90-df-rosser-sentence\">90-df-rosser-sentence</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\">\\(\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\)</span> (effective axiomatizability and metatheoretic consistency)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{RosserSent}_T(R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash R\\land T\\nvdash\\neg R\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rosser\\text{-}sentence}\\ \\vdash\\\n\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{REAx}_{S,g}(T)\\land\\operatorname{Con}^{\\mathrm{meta}}(T)\\land \\operatorname{Ax}(Q)\\subseteq T\n\\land\\mathrm{RosserSent}_T(R)\n\\Bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow\n\\bigl(T\\nvdash R\\land T\\nvdash\\neg R\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Proof\">[Proof]</h2>\n<p>假设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash R\">\\(T\\vdash R\\)</span>，取真实证明码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_0\">\\(p_0\\)</span>。逐数表示给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prf}_T(\\bar p_0,\\overline{g(R)})\">\\(T\\vdash\\mathrm{Prf}_T(\\bar p_0,\\overline{g(R)})\\)</span>。一致性排除任何 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg R\">\\(\\neg R\\)</span> 的证明码，因而对于有限多个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\le p_0\">\\(q\\le p_0\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 分别证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_T(\\bar q,\\overline{g(\\neg R)})\">\\(\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_T(\\bar q,\\overline{g(\\neg R)})\\)</span>。有限比较引理将这些证明合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\forall q\\le\\bar p_0\\,\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_T(q,\\overline{g(\\neg R)})\">\\(T\\vdash\\forall q\\le\\bar p_0\\,\\neg\\mathrm{Prf}_T(q,\\overline{g(\\neg R)})\\)</span>，与 Rosser 等价及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 矛盾。</p>\n<p>已得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\nvdash R\">\\(T\\nvdash R\\)</span>。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\vdash\\neg R\">\\(T\\vdash\\neg R\\)</span>，取其证明码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q_0\">\\(q_0\\)</span>。对所有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p&lt;q_0\">\\(p&lt;q_0\\)</span>，无 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 的证明，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 可证相应有限的否定证明式；同时 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\vdash\\mathrm{Prf}_T(\\bar q_0,\\overline{g(\\neg R)})\">\\(Q\\vdash\\mathrm{Prf}_T(\\bar q_0,\\overline{g(\\neg R)})\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 证明任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 或小于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar q_0\">\\(\\bar q_0\\)</span>，或满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar q_0\\le p\">\\(\\bar q_0\\le p\\)</span>。第一分支使 Rosser 蕴涵前件为假，第二分支以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q=\\bar q_0\">\\(q=\\bar q_0\\)</span> 作见证，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 证明整个 Rosser 右端，进而证明 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，再次矛盾。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rosser 句子的独立性不需要 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>-一致性，但仍需要有效公理化、普通一致性以及足以形式化有限证明比较的算术基础。</li>\n<li>结论针对满足上游固定点定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>，不是任意带有该名称的句子。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Proof","text":"[Proof]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"88-df-provable","status":"resolved","id":"b7bcf1e41c4a9fc9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[88-df-provable]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-rosser-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"7c51b51998a67f02","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-rosser-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-proof-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"8c071ce52fa72de0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-proof-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolved","id":"4e89323a1592aeb9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-consistency-statement]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-robinson-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"b7d7a03ff76428de","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-robinson-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory","status":"resolved","id":"002c574215686062","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-effectively-axiomatized-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-lem-q-finite-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"25356da0f2b0b22e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-lem-q-finite-comparison]]","embed":false},{"target":"90-df-arithmetic-language","status":"resolved","id":"278a6c2cfc6160a3","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[90-df-arithmetic-language]]","embed":false},{